  "description": "Given a string s, find the length of the longest substring without repeating characters using the sliding window technique.",
  "target": 3,
  "pseudocode": "function lengthOfLongestSubstring(s):\n  let charMap = new Map(), maxLen = 0, left = 0\n  for right = 0 to s.length - 1:\n    if charMap.has(s[right]) and charMap.get(s[right]) >= left:\n      left = charMap.get(s[right]) + 1\n    charMap.set(s[right], right)\n    maxLen = max(maxLen, right - left + 1)\n  return maxLen",
